---
// Landing page implemented from the Claude Design mockup "Eva Landing Page".
// Markup keeps the design's inline styles for fidelity; the <style> block below
// adds base styles and responsive overrides the mockup didn't define.
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
  <title>Eva — the first AI made for women</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Eva is the first AI assistant built around a woman's physiology — your cycle, energy, and goals. Enter your Prime Era on your own terms." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;600;700&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>

<div style="max-width:100%; overflow-x:hidden;">

  <!-- NAV -->
  <header style="position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50; background:rgba(251,248,251,.82); backdrop-filter:blur(14px); border-bottom:1px solid #EFE6ED;">
    <nav style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px 32px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px;">
      <a href="/"><img src="/assets/eva-logo.png" alt="Eva" style="height:34px; width:auto; display:block;" /></a>
      <div class="nav-links" style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:34px; font-size:15px; font-weight:500; color:#5A4B55;">
        <a href="#how" style="color:#5A4B55;">How it works</a>
        <a href="#features" style="color:#5A4B55;">Features</a>
        <a href="#science" style="color:#5A4B55;">Science</a>
        <a href="#mission" style="color:#5A4B55;">Mission</a>
        <a href="#faq" style="color:#5A4B55;">FAQ</a>
      </div>
      <a href="#download" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8E2C57,#C96A93); color:#fff; padding:11px 22px; border-radius:999px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; box-shadow:0 8px 20px -8px rgba(142,44,87,.6); white-space:nowrap;">Get the app</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section style="position:relative; overflow:hidden;">
    <div style="position:absolute; top:-160px; right:-120px; width:520px; height:520px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,#EFEAF6,transparent 68%); z-index:0;"></div>
    <div style="position:absolute; bottom:-180px; left:-140px; width:460px; height:460px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle,#E6F0E9,transparent 70%); z-index:0;"></div>
    <div class="hero-grid" style="position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:72px 32px 88px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr; gap:56px; align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <span style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:#FBEDF3; color:#8E2C57; padding:7px 15px; border-radius:999px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.01em;">
          <span style="width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:#C96A93;"></span>Meet Eva — your AI health companion
        </span>
        <h1 style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:66px; line-height:1.03; color:#3A2233; margin:22px 0 0; letter-spacing:-.01em; text-wrap:balance;">Enter your <span style="font-style:italic; color:#8E2C57;">Prime Era</span>, on your own terms.</h1>
        <p style="font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; margin:24px 0 0; max-width:520px; color:#6E5E69;">Eva is the first AI assistant built around a woman's physiology — your cycle, energy, and goals. Stop fighting your body. Start working <em>with</em> it.</p>

        <div style="margin:34px 0 0; display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="#download" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:11px; background:#3A2233; color:#fff; padding:14px 20px; border-radius:14px;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M16.5 12.6c0-2 1.6-3 1.7-3.1-1-1.4-2.4-1.6-2.9-1.6-1.2-.1-2.4.7-3 .7s-1.6-.7-2.6-.7c-1.3 0-2.6.8-3.3 2-1.4 2.4-.4 6 1 8 .7 1 1.4 2 2.5 2s1.4-.6 2.6-.6 1.5.6 2.6.6 1.8-1 2.4-2c.8-1.1 1.1-2.2 1.1-2.3-.1 0-2.1-.8-2.1-3.1zM14.6 6.2c.6-.7 1-1.7.9-2.7-.9 0-1.9.6-2.5 1.3-.5.6-1 1.6-.9 2.6 1 .1 2-.5 2.5-1.2z"/></svg>
            <span style="text-align:left; line-height:1.1;"><span style="display:block; font-size:11px; opacity:.8;">Download on the</span><span style="display:block; font-size:17px; font-weight:600;">App Store</span></span>
          </a>
          <a href="#download" style="display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:11px; background:#fff; color:#3A2233; padding:14px 20px; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid #EADFE8;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3.6 2.4c-.3.2-.5.6-.5 1.1v17c0 .5.2.9.5 1.1l9.2-9.6-9.2-9.6z" fill="#C96A93"/><path d="M16.4 8.9 12.8 12l3.6 3.1 3.9-2.2c.7-.4.7-1.4 0-1.8l-3.9-2.2z" fill="#8E2C57"/><path d="M12.8 12 3.6 2.4c.3-.2.7-.2 1.1 0l11.7 6.5-3.6 3.1z" fill="#E1A6C2"/><path d="m12.8 12 3.6 3.1L4.7 21.6c-.4.2-.8.2-1.1 0l9.2-9.6z" fill="#7E9BBE"/></svg>
            <span style="text-align:left; line-height:1.1;"><span style="display:block; font-size:11px; color:#98868F;">GET IT ON</span><span style="display:block; font-size:17px; font-weight:600;">Google Play</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div style="margin:32px 0 0; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;">
          <div style="display:flex;">
            <span style="width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C96A93,#E9C4D6); border:2px solid #FBF8FB; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px;">M</span>
            <span style="width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8FB09A,#CADFCE); border:2px solid #FBF8FB; margin-left:-12px; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px;">S</span>
            <span style="width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7E9BBE,#C4D4E6); border:2px solid #FBF8FB; margin-left:-12px; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:14px;">A</span>
            <span style="width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8E2C57,#C96A93); border:2px solid #FBF8FB; margin-left:-12px; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-weight:700; font-size:12px;">+9k</span>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:14.5px; color:#7A6A75;"><strong style="color:#3A2233;">Joined by 12,000+ women</strong><br />building their Glow Up with Eva.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PHONE MOCKUP -->
      <div style="position:relative; display:flex; justify-content:center;">
        <div style="position:absolute; inset:6% 14%; background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#EFEAF6,transparent 70%); filter:blur(10px);"></div>
        <div style="position:relative; width:310px; height:635px; background:#2B1A26; border-radius:46px; padding:11px; box-shadow:0 40px 80px -30px rgba(58,34,51,.5); animation:floaty 6s ease-in-out infinite;">
          <div style="position:relative; width:100%; height:100%; background:#FBF7FA; border-radius:36px; overflow:hidden;">
            <!-- status bar -->
            <div style="position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:3; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:14px 22px 6px; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; color:#3A2233;">
              <span>9:41</span>
              <span style="width:78px; height:22px; background:#2B1A26; border-radius:0 0 14px 14px; position:absolute; left:50%; top:0; transform:translateX(-50%);"></span>
              <span style="display:flex; gap:5px; align-items:center;">
                <svg width="17" height="11" viewBox="0 0 17 11" fill="#3A2233"><rect x="0" y="7" width="3" height="4" rx="1"/><rect x="4" y="5" width="3" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="8" y="3" width="3" height="8" rx="1"/><rect x="12" y="1" width="3" height="10" rx="1"/></svg>
                <svg width="18" height="11" viewBox="0 0 18 11" fill="none"><rect x="1" y="1" width="14" height="9" rx="2.5" stroke="#3A2233" stroke-width="1.2"/><rect x="2.6" y="2.6" width="9" height="5.8" rx="1.2" fill="#3A2233"/><rect x="16" y="4" width="1.6" height="3.5" rx=".8" fill="#3A2233"/></svg>
              </span>
            </div>

            <!-- app content -->
            <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; padding:52px 18px 74px; overflow:hidden;">
              <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;">
                <div>
                  <p style="font-size:13px; color:#98868F;">Good morning,</p>
                  <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:600; color:#3A2233; line-height:1;">Maya</p>
                </div>
                <span style="width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#C96A93,#E9C4D6); display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-weight:700;">M</span>
              </div>

              <!-- cycle card -->
              <div style="margin-top:16px; background:linear-gradient(140deg,#8E2C57,#C96A93); border-radius:22px; padding:18px; color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; box-shadow:0 16px 30px -14px rgba(142,44,87,.7);">
                <div style="position:relative; width:78px; height:78px; flex-shrink:0;">
                  <svg width="78" height="78" viewBox="0 0 78 78" style="position:absolute; inset:0; transform:rotate(-90deg);">
                    <circle cx="39" cy="39" r="32" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.25)" stroke-width="7"/>
                    <circle cx="39" cy="39" r="32" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="201" stroke-dashoffset="90"/>
                  </svg>
                  <div style="position:absolute; inset:0; display:grid; place-items:center; text-align:center; line-height:1;">
                    <div><div style="font-size:22px; font-weight:700;">14</div><div style="font-size:9px; opacity:.85;">DAY</div></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700;">Ovulation phase</p>
                  <p style="font-size:12.5px; opacity:.9; margin-top:3px; line-height:1.4;">Peak energy — a great day for a strength session.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- shortcuts -->
              <div style="margin-top:16px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:9px;">
                <div style="background:#EFEAF6; border-radius:16px; padding:11px 6px; text-align:center;">
                  <div style="width:30px; height:30px; margin:0 auto 5px; border-radius:9px; background:#fff; display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8E2C57" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4.5" width="18" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 2.5v4M16 2.5v4"/></svg></div>
                  <span style="font-size:9.5px; color:#5A4B55; font-weight:600;">Cycle</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#E6F0E9; border-radius:16px; padding:11px 6px; text-align:center;">
                  <div style="width:30px; height:30px; margin:0 auto 5px; border-radius:9px; background:#fff; display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6E9C7E" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 21c5-3 8-7 8-11a5 5 0 0 0-8-4 5 5 0 0 0-8 4c0 4 3 8 8 11z"/></svg></div>
                  <span style="font-size:9.5px; color:#5A4B55; font-weight:600;">Nutrition</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#FBEDF3; border-radius:16px; padding:11px 6px; text-align:center;">
                  <div style="width:30px; height:30px; margin:0 auto 5px; border-radius:9px; background:#fff; display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C96A93" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6.5 6.5 4 9m2.5-2.5L9 4M17.5 17.5 20 15m-2.5 2.5L15 20m-8-3 10-10"/></svg></div>
                  <span style="font-size:9.5px; color:#5A4B55; font-weight:600;">Trainer</span>
                </div>
                <div style="background:#E7EDF5; border-radius:16px; padding:11px 6px; text-align:center;">
                  <div style="width:30px; height:30px; margin:0 auto 5px; border-radius:9px; background:#fff; display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6E8CB0" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-6 6c0 2 1 3 1 5h10c0-2 1-3 1-5a6 6 0 0 0-6-6zM9 20h6M10 22h4"/></svg></div>
                  <span style="font-size:9.5px; color:#5A4B55; font-weight:600;">Mind</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- chat -->
              <div style="margin-top:15px; background:#fff; border:1px solid #EFE6ED; border-radius:18px; padding:13px;">
                <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:flex-start;">
                  <span style="width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8E2C57,#C96A93); flex-shrink:0; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#fff; font-size:12px; font-weight:700;">E</span>
                  <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; color:#5A4B55; background:#F7F1F5; padding:9px 11px; border-radius:12px 12px 12px 3px;">Your iron looks a little low this week. Want a menu that helps?</p>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top:11px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:#F7F1F5; border-radius:12px; padding:8px 12px;">
                  <span style="font-size:12px; color:#A695A0; flex:1;">Ask Eva anything…</span>
                  <span style="width:26px; height:26px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8E2C57,#C96A93); display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#fff"><path d="M3 20.5 21 12 3 3.5 6 12l-3 8.5z"/></svg></span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- tab bar -->
            <div style="position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; height:60px; background:#fff; border-top:1px solid #EFE6ED; display:flex; justify-content:space-around; align-items:center; padding:0 14px;">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#8E2C57"><path d="M12 3 3 10v10h6v-6h6v6h6V10z"/></svg>
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C3B4BE" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4.5" width="18" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18"/></svg>
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C3B4BE" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 19V9l8-5 8 5v10M9 19v-6h6v6"/></svg>
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#C3B4BE" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- LOGO STRIP / VALUES -->
  <section style="border-top:1px solid #EFE6ED; border-bottom:1px solid #EFE6ED; background:#fff;">
    <div style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:26px 32px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; align-items:center;">
      <span style="font-size:13.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#A695A0; font-weight:600;">Designed around her, not the default</span>
      <div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:28px 36px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:600; color:#5A4B55;">
        <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8FB09A" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Hormone-aware</span>
        <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8FB09A" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Science-backed</span>
        <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8FB09A" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Private by design</span>
        <span style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8FB09A" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Made with women</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROBLEM / INVISIBLE WOMEN -->
  <section id="science" class="section-pad" style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:92px 32px;">
    <div style="text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto;">
      <span style="font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#C96A93; font-weight:700;">The invisible gap</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:46px; line-height:1.1; color:#3A2233; margin:14px 0 0; text-wrap:balance;">For decades, the world was built for the male body.</h2>
      <p style="font-size:18px; line-height:1.6; margin:18px 0 0; color:#6E5E69;">In <em>Invisible Women</em>, Caroline Criado Perez documents how a data gap left women's needs an afterthought — in medicine, safety, and technology.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-grid" style="margin-top:52px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #EFE6ED; border-radius:20px; padding:26px 22px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:48px; font-weight:700; color:#8E2C57; line-height:1;">5°C</p>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-top:12px; color:#6E5E69;">Standard office temperatures can run ~5°C colder than what's comfortable for women.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #EFE6ED; border-radius:20px; padding:26px 22px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:48px; font-weight:700; color:#8E2C57; line-height:1;">47%</p>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-top:12px; color:#6E5E69;">More likely to be seriously injured in comparable crashes — female dummies arrived only in 2011.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #EFE6ED; border-radius:20px; padding:26px 22px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:48px; font-weight:700; color:#8E2C57; line-height:1;">70%</p>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-top:12px; color:#6E5E69;">Speech recognition was up to 70% more accurate at understanding male voices.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#8E2C57,#C96A93); border-radius:20px; padding:26px 22px; color:#fff;">
        <p style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:48px; font-weight:700; line-height:1;">Eva</p>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.55; margin-top:12px; opacity:.95;">Closes the gap on a personal level — an assistant that finally accounts for <em>you</em>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HOW / FEATURES GRID -->
  <section id="features" style="background:#F4EFF5;">
    <div class="section-pad" style="max-width:1200px; margin:0 auto; padding:92px 32px;">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;">
        <span style="font-size:13px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#C96A93; font-weight:700;">One companion, every day</span>
        <h2 class="h2" style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-weight:600; font-size:46px; line-height:1.1; color:#3A2233; margin:14px 0 0;">Everything Eva does for you</h2>
        <p style="font-size:18px; line-height:1.6; margin:16px 0 0; color:#6E5E69;">Eva reads your physiology, hormonal cycle, emotional state, habits and goals — then guides your day with them, not against them.</p>
      </div>

      <div id="how" class="features-grid" style="margin-top:54px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:22px;">
        <div style="background:#fff; border-radius:22px; padding:30px; border:1px solid #EDE1EA;">
          <div style="width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:15px; background:#EFEAF6; display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8E2C57" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="4.5" width="18" height="17" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 2.5v4M16 2.5v4"/></svg></div>
          <h3 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:#3A2233; margin:20px 0 0;">Cycle-aware calendar</h3>
          <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; margin:9px 0 0;">Track your cycle, sex life and training in one view — and see how each phase shapes your energy.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#fff; border-radius:22px; padding:30px; border:1px solid #EDE1EA;">
          <div style="width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:15px; background:#E6F0E9; display:grid; place-items:center;"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6E9C7E" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 21c5-3 8-7 8-11a5 5 0 0 0-8-4 5 5 0 0 0-8 4c0 4 3 8 8 11z"/></svg></div>
          <h3 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:700; color:#3A2233; margin:20px 0 0;">Nutrition adviser</h3>
          <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; margin:9px 0 0;">Calorie and nutrient guidance tuned to your goals, preferences, deficiencies and cycle phase.</p>
